WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.400
This is Jace Morgan.

2
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.900
He's fifteen, he's funny, and his phone never leaves his hand.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.600
Jace thinks he's a pretty good person.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.100
His mom thinks he's at the library.

5
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.900
He isn't.

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.600
His friend Maya keeps inviting him to youth group.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.900
He keeps laughing it off.

8
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.900
And the video he posted of Eli?

9
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.800
It's going viral.

10
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.200
Hello?

11
00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:49.450
Where am I?

12
00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.100
Where's my phone?

13
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.000
You won't need it, Jace.

14
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.200
Everything on it, and everything that never was, has already been saved.
